# member set is the held view's is joint over it by construction. The fourth review's fix is in helloHolds (§10.10.6): a HELLO that
# names holds is an announcement, so the release follows it even when it went out at epoch 0, where no ask does; and holds() has its
# common-case fast path, since gate() calls it on the write path. Apply with: git apply docs/leave-release.diff (then drop the `V`
# line and every use of it).
